1 0 obj<</Author(pinkzero)/CreationDate(D:20261101005531+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Mature, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Post-Canon, Canon Continuation, Canon Compliant, Missing Scene, Angst with a Happy Ending, Minor Bow/Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Minor Entrapta/Hordak \(She-Ra\), Mentions of Shadow Weaver, Mentions of Horde Prime - Freeform, Mentions of Swift Wind, Best Friend Squad \(She-Ra\), Jump Attack, Violence, Implied/Referenced Child Abuse, Implied Sexual Content, Madeup Festival, Catra is Bad at Feelings \(She-Ra\), Adora is Bad at Feelings too \(She-Ra\), Moves from the past and into the future explaining why we got the season 5 Shera we got, There's a lot of internal Catra thoughts about certain Canon scenes, Adora was hard to write because she's really good at avoiding thoughts, This was supposed to be 50/50 perspective-wise but it definitely didn't end up that way, But I promise that Adora does think sometimes, Haha. Promise., Tags May Change, tags are for the entire story, Has a posting schedule / will finish, F/F, Graphic Depictions Of Violence, Flashbacks)/ModDate(D:20261101005531+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(When my Mask becomes your Crown)>>
