<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">When my Mask becomes your Crown</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œCatra, you know you can ask me anything.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora-as-She-ra is looking down at her, an entirely non-existent wind billowing the long flowing wisp of her ponytail behind her. Catra has been wanting to ask this since she first saw Adora transform on Darla and she decided that she can - that she should right now but now she doesnâ€™t know where the rest of her words have gone. She doesnâ€™t know what words to use to ask, but she knows that she must.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She wills her feet to pad over the three steps she needs to get into Adoraâ€™s glowing space and raises onto the balls of her feet - extending a single finger to tap a claw on the perfectly shining gold plating framing Adoraâ€™s face.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Catraâ€™s mask. On She-Ra form. On Adora.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>pinkzero</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Continuation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Missing Scene</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst with a Happy Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Minor Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Minor Entrapta/Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentions of Shadow Weaver</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentions of Horde Prime - Freeform</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentions of Swift Wind</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Best Friend Squad (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Jump Attack</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Child Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied Sexual Content</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Madeup Festival</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is Bad at Feelings (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is Bad at Feelings too (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Moves from the past and into the future explaining why we got the season 5 Shera we got</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>There's a lot of internal Catra thoughts about certain Canon scenes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora was hard to write because she's really good at avoiding thoughts</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>This was supposed to be 50/50 perspective-wise but it definitely didn't end up that way</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>But I promise that Adora does think sometimes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Haha. Promise.</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Tags May Change</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>tags are for the entire story</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Has a posting schedule / will finish</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
